; ================================================================
; palette.inc - Parodius colour blocks (data only), editable
;   265 blocks, decoded from the packed 9-bit ROM format.
;   Edit the rgb(r,g,b) values (each component 0..7). The #RRGGBB
;   comment above each 16-colour group is a VS Code preview swatch
;   strip (regenerate to refresh after edits). The .db before each
;   block is its group count.
;   Block header = where the palette loads: BG or sprite section +
;   subpalette index (decimal 0-15), then size (1 subpalette = 16 colours).
;   'used:' = level(s)/mode that loaded it (L1 also covers title/menu/
;   intro/ending; Special-1 = $0A select + 1st half, Special-2 = $0B
;   score-gated 2nd half; ? = not seen in the tagged run).
;   Requires palette_macros.inc (rgb()/pal8) - include it first.
; ================================================================

